  "independent_transcript": "The letter reaches you wrapped in sailcloth. Iona, they have repaired the catalogue but not the truth. Come before the winter register is pulped. Ask why the midnight bell was silent. Mara. Seventeen years ago, the East Reach flood killed twenty-three people. Your father, lockkeeper Thomas Fale, was named responsible. You left Leith to learn how to repair paper. Now its archivist has vanished, and the city wants to burn its damaged records. words. The fairy brings you home under a sky the color of old pewter. Naughty Belle ties the boat with the same knot she used when you were a child. Nobody disappears from a city this small, she says, but a city can agree not to look.",
